{"id":"n17254-3-3","stage":1,"title":"못 · 没达到一定水平或状态","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17254-3-3-1","ko":"그 가게는 술을 파는 덴데.","zh":"那家店是卖酒的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那样，那个","explanation":"그：那样，那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가게는","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"술을","meaning":"酒","explanation":"술：酒；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"술","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65157","senseId":"1","lemma":"술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"파는","meaning":"卖，出售","explanation":"팔다：卖，出售；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"팔다","audio":"/audio/2aa6e349da8a806dc3d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71482","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"덴데.","meaning":"处所，地方。","explanation":"데：处所，地方。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"데","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47455","senseId":"1","lemma":"데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那样，那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"62250","definition":"指代前面已经讲过或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"803d2c68651cecea","term":"술","zh":"酒","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3","entryId":"65157","definition":"像啤酒或烧酒等那样含有酒精成分、喝后会醉的饮料。","pronunciation":["술"]},{"id":"2aa6e349da8a806d","term":"팔다","zh":"卖，出售","audio":"/audio/2aa6e349da8a806dc3d5.mp3","entryId":"71482","definition":"收取钱财将物品或权利交给对方或提供劳动力等。","pronunciation":["팔다"]},{"id":"16cb0f76ae2e2fc7","term":"데","zh":"处所，地方。","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3","entryId":"47455","definition":"处所，地方。","pronunciation":["데"]}],"audio":"/audio/41a96e34020ebf8dcc50.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17254-3-3-2","ko":"맞아. 그 장소는 애들이 있을 곳이 못 되는 것 같아.","zh":"对。那个地方好像不太适合小孩子待。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아.","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"장소는","meaning":"场所，地点","explanation":"장소：场所，地点；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"장소","audio":"/audio/61eaecc09cb7e53dbc6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30185","senseId":"1","lemma":"장소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"애들이","meaning":"孩子，小孩","explanation":"애：孩子，小孩；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"애","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73967","senseId":"1","lemma":"애","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있을","meaning":"待着","explanation":"있다：待着；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68796","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곳이","meaning":"处，地方","explanation":"곳：处，地方；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"2","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"没达到一定水平或状态，或者不适合或不足为标准。","explanation":"못：没达到一定水平或状态，或者不适合或不足为标准。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"3","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되는","meaning":"变得，弄得","explanation":"되다：变得，弄得；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"正是或没错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"61eaecc09cb7e53d","term":"장소","zh":"场所，地点","audio":"/audio/61eaecc09cb7e53dbc6e.mp3","entryId":"30185","definition":"某事发生的地方；或指进行某事的地方。","pronunciation":["장소"]},{"id":"a9fee06ad11f5bbd","term":"애","zh":"孩子，小孩","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3","entryId":"73967","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["애ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"待着","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68796","definition":"人或动物停留在某处，不离开。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"处，地方","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"抽象的地点或位置。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"没达到一定水平或状态，或者不适合或不足为标准。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"没达到一定水平或状态，或者不适合或不足为标准。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得，弄得","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"达到某种情况或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/388dd4eca5e7d11a286d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.997,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=17254","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":37,"sequenceScore":1.741,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那家店是卖酒的。","对。那个地方好像不太适合小孩子待。","水里的鱼全都看得见！"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那家店是卖酒的。","对。那个地方好像不太适合小孩子待。","水里的鱼全都看得见！"],"answer":1}]}
